  (b) Submit signed enhancement proposals to the Software's permitted
      declarative extension surface (`extensions/`) via the official packager.

================================================================================
3. STRICT PROHIBITIONS (ANTI-CLONE & ANTI-AI-COPY)
================================================================================
Without the prior written and signed permission of the copyright holder, the
following actions are strictly PROHIBITED:

  1. NO FORKING / REDISTRIBUTION:
     Copying, reproducing, publishing on another GitHub/Git repository,
     redistributing, or selling all or any part of the Software.

  2. NO REVERSE ENGINEERING:
     Decompiling, disassembling, reverse engineering, modifying, or bypassing
     compiled builds (`User Edition`), binaries, or cryptographic signature /
     watermark mechanisms.

  3. NO AI CLONING / TRAINING:
     Feeding the Software's code, architectural contract, prompt structures,
     UI, or documentation into any Large Language Model (LLM), coding agent,
     or AI system to generate, clone, or replicate a similar/derivative
     project, or for model training or fine-tuning.

  4. NO DERIVATIVE WORKS:
     Developing a similar or competing software, plugin, or service based on
     the architectural flow or components of this Software.

